## Build the APK

**Android Studio:** open this folder, wait for Gradle sync, then *Build > Build APK(s)*.

**Command line** (needs JDK 17, Gradle 8.2+ and the Android SDK):

```bash
gradle assembleDebug
```

The APK appears in `app/build/outputs/apk/debug/`.

**GitHub Actions:** push this project to GitHub and run the *Build APK* workflow.

Note: pages are loaded from `file://`, so use plain HTML/CSS/JS (no `fetch` to local files).

